    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέρφος</span></b> , ὁ, a small
		winged insect, prob. a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gnat</i> or <i>winged ant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				352
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				82
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				569
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicopho
				1
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				34
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνεστι κἀν μύρμηκι κἀν
